- Use `manage_texture_import` (actions: `get_settings`, `set_settings`, `set_settings_batch`, `find_assets`, `get_info`, `set_type`, `set_platform_settings`, `get_platform_settings`, `set_sprite_settings`, `find_by_size`) for texture-specific import settings.
